Training: 631 fcc orderings (1-8 atoms), relaxed (positions + cell, fmax 2e-3). CE cutoffs [9.0, 6.0, 5.0] A, ARDR, rmse train 0.46 / CV 0.50 meV/atom, 41 nonzero of 41 ECIs.

